B.apv=new A.F(372,B.YP)
B.Y7=s(["Listening now has real system controls: a media notification + lock-screen transport (play/pause/next/previous), and it responds to Bluetooth media buttons \u2014 including a tap on your Ray-Ban Meta glasses to pause/resume. Works for both spoken (TTS) and recorded playback."],t.s)
B.apl=new A.F(371,B.Y7)
B.X6=s(["Fixed: you can type into a fresh new note again \u2014 its tap target was too thin to focus. It\u2019s a comfortable size now (still not tall).","The Listening player is now two rows: the current item\u2019s overview on top, the play controls below. Tap the overview (\u25ce) to jump the list back to whatever\u2019s playing."],t.s)
B.anl=new A.F(370,B.X6)
